Cell["2. Evolution", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"ec57c750-105c-e443-9ee8-44e73c13f88e"],

Cell["\<\
Every edge of every state is a place the subdivision rule fits, so each \
generation has one more edge to work on than the last:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"24edce5b-3d72-6c47-92b4-c9dcb2db81a9"],

