Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Design note.  ",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "The two halves share a layout because otherwise a rewrite that moved \
nothing would look like it had moved everything: two spring embeddings of \
nearly the same hypergraph come out differently, and the eye reads the \
difference as the event. A vertex the event created has no place in the old \
layout, so it is settled among its neighbours \[LongDash] which puts a vertex \
inserted into an edge between that edge's two ends, where it belongs."
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{2, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellFrameMargins->{{10, 0}, {6, 6}},
 CellFrameColor->GrayLevel[0.7],
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.25],ExpressionUUID->"5532536a-8f52-e44d-8ea2-eed2bff71f94"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Design note.  ",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "Which edges of the result to highlight is read off \"EdgeOrigins\" rather \
than found by looking for edges equal to \"NewEdges\". In a multiset two \
edges of equal value are still two edges, and a rule that creates an edge the \
hypergraph already had would otherwise highlight the wrong one."
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{2, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellFrameMargins->{{10, 0}, {6, 6}},
 CellFrameColor->GrayLevel[0.7],
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.25],ExpressionUUID->"5d97df2d-fb2d-4a40-b742-de5c7dc68dd9"],

Cell["The graphs", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"e9a0b56b-4cc7-0d44-b9df-f7a749f12c1c"],

Cell["The states of an evolution, each drawn:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fec6098c-5d25-8646-a2a0-b0e561ca2e99"],

Cell["\<\
HypergraphRewritingSystem[subdivide, Hypergraph[{{1, \
2}}]][\"EvolutionGraph\", 2,
  ImageSize -> 420, \"PanelSize\" -> 110]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"d748b7bf-b7ea-844d-acb1-d16f68f3cfce"],

