Cell["Holding options on the system", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"bfc5cbb9-e22b-ee4d-bb05-05bd06ba6909"],

Cell["\<\
A system can carry the options that describe it, so they are not retyped on \
every call:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c1ad1bf8-a73e-2e4b-8789-12135104e0fa"],

Cell["\<\
strict = HypergraphRewritingSystem[subdivide, Hypergraph[{{1, 2}, {2, 3}}],
  \"CausalDependence\" -> \"Edges\", \"PanelSize\" -> 70];
strict\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"7a9f57b6-3cd1-af44-8752-9dd4a03cb3ea"],

